  "slug": "the-result-of-coveting-little-advantages",
  "audio_url": "/audio/russian/3343_the-result-of-coveting-little-advantages.mp3",
  "english_paragraphs": [
    "Xiao Zhang was always looking for ways to get a little something for free. One day, he received a sizable paycheck. When Xiao Li found out, he asked Xiao Zhang to treat him to a meal. Xiao Zhang had no choice but to agree.",
    "While they were eating, Xiao Zhang said to Xiao Li, “I’m paying for this meal, but when you get paid, you have to treat me too!”",
    "Some time later, Xiao Li got paid. Remembering their agreement, he took Xiao Zhang out to eat. But unexpectedly, Xiao Zhang ended up spending even more money this time. Since Xiao Li was paying, Xiao Zhang ate as much as he could. He ate so much that he made himself sick and had to go to the hospital."
  ],
  "english_full": "Xiao Zhang was always looking for ways to get a little something for free. One day, he received a sizable paycheck. When Xiao Li found out, he asked Xiao Zhang to treat him to a meal. Xiao Zhang had no choice but to agree.\n\nWhile they were eating, Xiao Zhang said to Xiao Li, “I’m paying for this meal, but when you get paid, you have to treat me too!”\n\nSome time later, Xiao Li got paid. Remembering their agreement, he took Xiao Zhang out to eat. But unexpectedly, Xiao Zhang ended up spending even more money this time. Since Xiao Li was paying, Xiao Zhang ate as much as he could. He ate so much that he made himself sick and had to go to the hospital.",
  "russian_paragraphs": [
    "Сяо Чжан всегда́ искал пути, чтобы получить немно́го чего-то беспла́тно. Одна́жды он получи́л при́нципиально́ крупную зарпла́ту. Когда́ Сяо Ли узнал об э́том, он спра́шивал Сяо Чжана, чтобы тот угощал его́ едой. Сяо Чжан не имел вы́бора и должен был согласиться.",
    "Пока́ они е́ли, Сяо Чжан ска́зал Сяо Ли: “Я пла́чу за э́ту еду, но когда́ ты получишь зарплату, ты должен угостить меня́ тоже!”",
    "Какое-то вре́мя спустя́ Сяо Ли получил зарплату. Вспо́мнив об их соглаше́нии, он пригласил Сяо Чжана поесть. Но неожиданно Сяо Чжан потра́тил на э́тот раз еще́ больше де́нег. Так как Сяо Ли плати́л, Сяо Чжан ку́шал сколько мог. Он съел сто́лько, что заболел и должен был по́ехать в больни́цу."
  ],
  "reading_paragraphs": [
    "Síao Chzhan vsegdá iskál putí, chtoby poluchít' nemnógo chegó-to besplátno. Odnázhdy on poluchíl príncipiólnó krúpnuú zarplátu. Kogdá Síao Li uznál ob ètom, on spráshival Síao Chzhaná, chtoby tot ugoštál ego édoj. Síao Chzhan ne iméla výbora i dolzhén byl soglásit'sya.",
    "Poká oni yéli, Síao Chzhan skázal Síao Li: “Ya pláchu za ètu édu, no kogdá ty poluchísh' zarplátu, ty dolzhén ugoštít' menya tózhe!”",
    "Kakóe-to vréme spustýa Síao Li poluchíl zarplátu. Vspomnív ob íkh sogláshenii, on priglášil Síao Chzhaná poést'. No neozhidánno Síao Chzhan potrátil na ètot raz eshchó bol'she déneg. Tak kák Síao Li plátil, Síao Chzhan kúshal skol'ko mog. On syél stol'ko, chto zabólél i dolzhén byl poéhat' v bol'nítsu."
  ],
